{"5461530":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"THE LAST STONE","steam_appid":5461530,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<strong>100 MILLION STONES. ONE TINY SHOVEL. ONE HIDDEN DIAMOND.<\/strong><br><br>The job is simple: find one diamond in a warehouse full of stones. Your starting equipment is a tiny yellow toy shovel. Someone has been optimistic.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start small. Very small.<\/h2>Get to work in first person, one scoop at a time. Choose a pile of 2, 10, 25 or 100 million stones. The tools and rules stay the same; the mountain gets bigger.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make every trip count<\/h2>Fill your carrying capacity, walk your load to material reception and sell what you have dug out. Each trip puts money towards the next improvement. Soon, the little dent you started with has room to grow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy a shovel fit for the job<\/h2>Move from the toy shovel to a garden shovel, then an industrial shovel. Upgrade your tools and carrying capacity, and invest in a skill tree with 46 upgrades across five branches: digging, movement, transport, economy and conveyors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Put your stones to work<\/h2>Add a cart for larger loads and supply a conveyor connected to material reception. It transports the stones you feed into it and sells them when they arrive. Decide where your next purchase will help your routine most.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little progress. An occasional surprise.<\/h2>Progress milestones and optional shovel challenges give you smaller goals along the way. Rare find notifications add a little dry humour to the shift. Every so often, a few surface stones slip and settle nearby.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The diamond is already in there<\/h2>One diamond is hidden in the pile from the start of each game. You could uncover it with your very first successful scoop, or have a much longer search ahead. There is no required amount to clear before it can be found. Better equipment helps you remove more material; the discovery comes when you reach the diamond.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four pile sizes: 2, 10, 25 or 100 million stones in one industrial hall.<br><\/li><li>First-person digging with a toy shovel, garden shovel and industrial shovel.<br><\/li><li>Carry your stones to material reception and sell them to fund better gear.<br><\/li><li>46 skill upgrades across five branches, plus tool and capacity upgrades.<br><\/li><li>Expand your transport routine with a cart and a conveyor you supply.<br><\/li><li>Progress milestones, optional shovel challenges and rare find notifications.<br><\/li><li>Exactly one hidden diamond per game, potentially found on your first successful scoop.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streamer &amp; Content Creator Friendly<\/h2><br>JuTiMa Games welcomes livestreams, Let's Plays, reviews, gameplay videos and clips featuring THE LAST STONE.<br><br>You are welcome to monetize your THE LAST STONE gameplay content on YouTube, Twitch and other video platforms.<br><br>This permission includes the in-game radio soundtrack when featured as part of genuine gameplay.<br><br>No separate permission from JuTiMa Games is required for these uses.<br><br>Automated copyright claims may occasionally occur despite authorized use. If you encounter a music-related claim, please contact JuTiMa Games with the relevant details so we can investigate.<br><br>Standalone soundtrack uploads, music redistribution and use of the songs independently of THE LAST STONE are not covered by this permission.<br>","about_the_game":"<strong>100 MILLION STONES. ONE TINY SHOVEL. ONE HIDDEN DIAMOND.<\/strong><br><br>The job is simple: find one diamond in a warehouse full of stones. Your starting equipment is a tiny yellow toy shovel. Someone has been optimistic.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start small. Very small.<\/h2>Get to work in first person, one scoop at a time. Choose a pile of 2, 10, 25 or 100 million stones. The tools and rules stay the same; the mountain gets bigger.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make every trip count<\/h2>Fill your carrying capacity, walk your load to material reception and sell what you have dug out. Each trip puts money towards the next improvement. Soon, the little dent you started with has room to grow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy a shovel fit for the job<\/h2>Move from the toy shovel to a garden shovel, then an industrial shovel. Upgrade your tools and carrying capacity, and invest in a skill tree with 46 upgrades across five branches: digging, movement, transport, economy and conveyors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Put your stones to work<\/h2>Add a cart for larger loads and supply a conveyor connected to material reception. It transports the stones you feed into it and sells them when they arrive. Decide where your next purchase will help your routine most.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little progress. An occasional surprise.<\/h2>Progress milestones and optional shovel challenges give you smaller goals along the way. Rare find notifications add a little dry humour to the shift. Every so often, a few surface stones slip and settle nearby.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The diamond is already in there<\/h2>One diamond is hidden in the pile from the start of each game. You could uncover it with your very first successful scoop, or have a much longer search ahead. There is no required amount to clear before it can be found. Better equipment helps you remove more material; the discovery comes when you reach the diamond.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four pile sizes: 2, 10, 25 or 100 million stones in one industrial hall.<br><\/li><li>First-person digging with a toy shovel, garden shovel and industrial shovel.<br><\/li><li>Carry your stones to material reception and sell them to fund better gear.<br><\/li><li>46 skill upgrades across five branches, plus tool and capacity upgrades.<br><\/li><li>Expand your transport routine with a cart and a conveyor you supply.<br><\/li><li>Progress milestones, optional shovel challenges and rare find notifications.<br><\/li><li>Exactly one hidden diamond per game, potentially found on your first successful scoop.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streamer &amp; Content Creator Friendly<\/h2><br>JuTiMa Games welcomes livestreams, Let's Plays, reviews, gameplay videos and clips featuring THE LAST STONE.<br><br>You are welcome to monetize your THE LAST STONE gameplay content on YouTube, Twitch and other video platforms.<br><br>This permission includes the in-game radio soundtrack when featured as part of genuine gameplay.<br><br>No separate permission from JuTiMa Games is required for these uses.<br><br>Automated copyright claims may occasionally occur despite authorized use. If you encounter a music-related claim, please contact JuTiMa Games with the relevant details so we can investigate.<br><br>Standalone soundtrack uploads, music redistribution and use of the songs independently of THE LAST STONE are not covered by this permission.<br>","short_description":"Up to 100 million stones, one tiny toy shovel and one hidden diamond. Dig, haul and sell stones to afford better gear in this absurd first-person incremental game. Start with a yellow plastic shovel. The diamond could be in your very first successful scoop.","supported_languages":"English, German","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5461530\/5a82e531572d0c43cad647cedc13b819a7621d6f\/header.jpg?t=1793700508","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5461530\/ad97228530ea42407aa7f9e24bab5da08ae5d452\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793700508","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5461530\/ad97228530ea42407aa7f9e24bab5da08ae5d452\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793700508","website":"https:\/\/jutima-games.de","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 \/ Intel Core i5-10400<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (6 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Provisional requirements; subject to change before release. Performance on this configuration has not yet been verified. Mouse and keyboard required.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"Trailer music: Investigations by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com). Source: https:\/\/incompetech.com\/music\/royalty-free\/index.html?isrc=USUAN1100646 . Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0): https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by\/4.0\/ . Changes: excerpt, EQ, volume automation, fade and mix with gameplay SFX. No endorsement.","developers":["JuTiMa Games"],"publishers":["JuTiMa Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":499,"final":499,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"4,99€"},"packages":[1884589],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy THE LAST STONE","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1884589,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"THE LAST STONE - 4,99€","option_descri